~ This is a file exclusively for explaining things relevant to the start of the game
  BASICS.bot will provide general information on how the dotbot coding language works ;

%WITH @BOTUTILS
~ always include this line, as it lets you use bot things, such as attacking, moving, and other things. ;


~ ATTACK - function (Keyword)
	ATTACK takes 2 parameters: the target, and the weapon to attack with.
	An ATTACk call should look something like as follows:
		BOTUTILS.ATTACK(target, weapon)
	1. target: an object of type ENEMY. Typically obtained through the function BOTUTILS.TARGET()
	2. weapon: an object of type WEAPON. Typically obtained through the function BOTUTILS.GETWEAPON()